  "text": "Alice: Hello, Bob! Nice weather today, isn't it?\n\nBob: Hey, Alice! Oh yeah, it's been sunny all morning.\n\nAlice: I know! It's such a great day for walking.\n\nBob: We should take a walk then. Let's go to the park.\n\nAlice: Wait, aren't you meeting Carol for lunch?\n\nBob: Yeah, but we can go back later. I'll wait for you.\n\nAlice: I'll be ready. Let's see you there at 2 PM.\n\nBob: 2 PM it is. I'll bring some snacks.\n\nAlice: Sounds good. We can have some sandwiches.\n\nBob: Any specific kind you like?\n\nAlice: Veggies and cheese. Just a few slices.\n\nBob: I'll get that. Thanks for planning, Alice.\n\nAlice: No problem. I'll meet you at the park.\n\nBob: Okay, talk to you then. Have a great day!\n\nAlice: You too, Bob. Take care!",
